{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S05只有18秒，却连续出现两组大量未标时出现的感受词，纵向交替的排法不如X左右分栏容易快速取舍；这一段尤其容易来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分栏更方便观众迅速区分故事和感受，完整句子也比较容易一遍读懂。但Y用加亮词直接标出每段心理转折，观众即使没有时间读完所有文字，也能抓住情节；到时出现的感受又能贴合音乐变化，把从害怕亲近、逐渐放松、期待互相依靠，到害怕失去、最终接受未知的过程表现得更细。尤其Y的感受不仅有情绪名称，还有呼吸、身体、声线、音符和水面变化，前后意象也有延续，因此整体体验更完整、更有层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3d706f1b-58ec-4bde-8996-44ce4192ad49", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T062553140007Z", "elapsed_seconds": 156.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:28:29.510477+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "abcf973fab5b926c1a3fdb4b89a584b6354b858a11c7f505d7ed1d49beb8f589", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools